  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "또 만났구나! 이번엔 패닉에 빠져\n절규하는 장면을 찍을 거란다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B6100020B9CCB0ACAD6CB09800210020C774BC88C5D40020D328B2C9C5D00020BE60C838000AC808ADDCD558B2940020C7A5BA74C7440020CC0DC7440020AC70B780B2E4002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자세히 말하자면, 고대의 포켓몬이\n현대에 되살아나서 마구 날뛰는 장면이지!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790C138D7880020B9D0D558C790BA74002C0020ACE0B300C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC774000AD604B300C5D00020B418C0B4C544B098C11C0020B9C8AD6C0020B0A0B6F0B2940020C7A5BA74C774C9C0002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그래서, 고대의 왕이라 불리던\n견고라스를 촬영하려고 했는데...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B798C11C002C0020ACE0B300C7580020C655C774B77C0020BD88B9ACB358000AACACACE0B77CC2A4B97C0020CD2CC601D558B824ACE00020D588B294B370002E002E002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고가의 화석을 통해\n복원해야 한다지 뭐냐!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 620,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0AC00C7580020D654C11DC7440020D1B5D574000ABCF5C6D0D574C57C0020D55CB2E4C9C00020BB50B0D0002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "자, 네가 나설 차례다!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C790002C0020B124AC000020B098C1240020CC28B840B2E40021002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "화석에서 복원시킨 티고라스를\n견고라스로 진화시켜서<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n촬영에 협조해 주지 않을래!?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D654C11DC5D0C11C0020BCF5C6D0C2DCD0A80020D2F0ACE0B77CC2A4B97C000AACACACE0B77CC2A4B85C0020C9C4D654C2DCCF1CC11C00100001BE00000ACD2CC601C5D00020D611C870D5740020C8FCC9C00020C54AC744B7980021003F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번에는 너도 엑스트라로\n출연하게 해 줄 테니까! 부탁이야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC88C5D0B2940020B108B3C40020C5D1C2A4D2B8B77CB85C000ACD9CC5F0D558AC8C0020D5740020C9040020D14CB2C8AE4C00210020BD80D0C1C774C57C002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "촬영에 협조해 줄 거라면\n견고라스를 지닌 포켓몬에 넣고 오렴!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CD2CC601C5D00020D611C870D5740020C9040020AC70B77CBA74000AACACACE0B77CC2A4B97C0020C9C0B2CC0020D3ECCF13BAACC5D00020B123ACE00020C624B834002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "예산이 없으면 방법이 없죠.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C608C0B0C7740020C5C6C73CBA740020BC29BC95C7740020C5C6C8E0002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고대의 포켓몬이라니\n여태껏 한 번도 못 봤어요...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B300C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC774B77CB2C8000AC5ECD0DCAECF0020D55C0020BC88B3C40020BABB0020BD24C5B4C694002E002E002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 견고라스를 데려왔다고!?\n촬영에 협조해 줄 거니?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020ACACACE0B77CC2A4B97C0020B370B824C654B2E4ACE00021003F000ACD2CC601C5D00020D611C870D5740020C9040020AC70B2C8003F00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "협조해 드릴게요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D611C870D5740020B4DCB9B4AC8CC69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "잠시만요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C7A0C2DCB9CCC6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "크윽... 이렇게 된 이상 감독인 내가\n탈을 쓰고 연기하는 수밖에 없나!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D06CC73D002E002E002E0020C774B807AC8C0020B41C0020C774C0C10020AC10B3C5C7780020B0B4AC00000AD0C8C7440020C4F0ACE00020C5F0AE30D558B2940020C218BC16C5D00020C5C6B098002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "믿고 있었다니까!\n엑스트라로도 멋진 활약을 부탁하마!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BBFFACE00020C788C5C8B2E4B2C8AE4C0021000AC5D1C2A4D2B8B77CB85CB3C40020BA4BC9C40020D65CC57DC7440020BD80D0C1D558B9C8002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그럼, 다들 잘해 보자고!\n레디... 액션!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B7FC002C0020B2E4B4E40020C798D5740020BCF4C790ACE00021000AB808B514002E002E002E0020C561C158002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저기... 저쪽을 봐 봐!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800AE30002E002E002E0020C800CABDC7440020BD100020BD10002100100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고라아아스!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B77CC544C544C2A400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저건 뭐지...!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800AC740020BB50C9C0002E002E002E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "괴... 괴수!?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1508,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AD34002E002E002E0020AD34C2180021003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이쪽으로 온다!!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1528,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774CABDC73CB85C0020C628B2E40021002100100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "고라아앙~",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ACE0B77CC544C559007E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "컷!!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CEF700210021002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "갑자기 주인한테 애교를 부리면 어떡해!\n분위기가 다 죽어 버렸잖아!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1588,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC11C790AE300020C8FCC778D55CD14C0020C560AD50B97C0020BD80B9ACBA740020C5B4B5A1D5740021000ABD84C704AE30AC000020B2E40020C8FDC5B40020BC84B838C796C544002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저... 감독님.\n견고라스는 생긴 건 저래도<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n애교부리기 기술을 배울 수 있대요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800002E002E002E0020AC10B3C5B2D8002E000AACACACE0B77CC2A4B2940020C0DDAE340020AC740020C800B798B3C400100001BE00000AC560AD50BD80B9ACAE300020AE30C220C7440020BC30C6B80020C2180020C788B300C694002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "성질은 사납지만\n트레이너에게는 애교가 많나 보네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C131C9C8C7400020C0ACB0A9C9C0B9CC000AD2B8B808C774B108C5D0AC8CB2940020C560AD50AC000020B9CEB0980020BCF4B124C694002E00100002011401950000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "뭐야!?\n주인과 같이 출연시킨 게 패착이었군!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BB50C57C0021003F000AC8FCC778ACFC0020AC19C7740020CD9CC5F0C2DCD0A80020AC8C0020D328CC29C774C5C8AD70002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "가만, 사람과 마음이 통하는\n고대의 포켓몬이라...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1904,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC00B9CC002C0020C0ACB78CACFC0020B9C8C74CC7740020D1B5D558B294000AACE0B300C7580020D3ECCF13BAACC774B77C002E002E002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "나름대로 괜찮겠는데!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1972,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B098B984B300B85C0020AD1CCC2EACA0B294B370002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "감독님, 정말 괜찮은 거 맞아요?\n매번 구상과 다르게 진행되는 거 같은데...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƖ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC10B3C5B2D8002C0020C815B9D00020AD1CCC2EC7400020AC700020B9DEC544C694003F000AB9E4BC880020AD6CC0C1ACFC0020B2E4B974AC8C0020C9C4D589B418B2940020AC700020AC19C740B370002E002E002E00100002011401960000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "후후... 걱정할 거 없네!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D6C4D6C4002E002E002E0020AC71C815D5600020AC700020C5C6B124002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이번 시리즈의 테마는 더 이상\n야생 포켓몬의 무시무시함이 아니라...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774BC880020C2DCB9ACC988C7580020D14CB9C8B2940020B3540020C774C0C1000AC57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACC7580020BB34C2DCBB34C2DCD568C7740020C544B2C8B77C002E002E002E00100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "야생 포켓몬과의 공생이니까!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C57CC0DD0020D3ECCF13BAACACFCC7580020ACF5C0DDC774B2C8AE4C002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "지금까지 촬영한 훈훈한 영상들과\n잘 어울리는 테마 아닌가!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2268,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C9C0AE08AE4CC9C00020CD2CC601D55C0020D6C8D6C8D55C0020C601C0C1B4E4ACFC000AC7980020C5B4C6B8B9ACB2940020D14CB9C80020C544B2CCAC00002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "단순히 무시무시함을 묘사하는 것보다\n오늘날의 미르에 부합하는 테마일 터!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B2E8C21CD7880020BB34C2DCBB34C2DCD568C7440020BB18C0ACD558B2940020AC83BCF4B2E4000AC624B298B0A0C7580020BBF8B974C5D00020BD80D569D558B2940020D14CB9C8C77C0020D130002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "좋아...!\n이번 시리즈는 분명 대박이 날 거야!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C88BC544002E002E002E0021000AC774BC880020C2DCB9ACC988B2940020BD84BA850020B300BC15C7740020B0A00020AC70C57C002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "대담하게 방향을 바꿀 수 있게 된 건\n다 네 덕분이다! 정말 고맙다!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŰ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B300B2F4D558AC8C0020BC29D5A5C7440020BC14AFC00020C2180020C788AC8C0020B41C0020AC74000AB2E40020B1240020B355BD84C774B2E400210020C815B9D00020ACE0B9D9B2E4002100100002011401700000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
